      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Record prior class, regimen, response, duration and reason for stopping.\nRepeat del(17p) FISH and TP53 sequencing; review fitness, renal function, TLS,\ninfection, cardiac/bleeding risk, interactions, preference and access.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "d310f25faba258ac96bb",
      "originalText": "Record prior class, regimen, response, duration and reason for stopping.\nRepeat del(17p) FISH and TP53 sequencing; review fitness, renal function, TLS,\ninfection, cardiac/bleeding risk, interactions, preference and access.",
