      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Sudden decline, high LDH\nor asymmetric growth:\nPET-CT + biopsy the most\nFDG-avid lesion.\nUse separate RT pathway;\nnot ordinary R/R sequence.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "8aed84b088e1a9675f74",
      "originalText": "Sudden decline, high LDH\nor asymmetric growth:\nPET-CT + biopsy the most\nFDG-avid lesion.\nUse separate RT pathway;\nnot ordinary R/R sequence.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
